/* ==================================================================
   S C O P ' D
   ------------------------------------------------------------------
   Black Ops II  //  Cronus Zen / GPC                     v1.0
   SNIPER BUILD  -  OFFLINE / BOT LOBBY / CAMPAIGN
   ------------------------------------------------------------------
   MENU        : hold L2 + tap OPTIONS
   MASTER KILL : hold L2 + tap SHARE

   IN MENU:
     D-UP / D-DOWN ....... move cursor
     D-LEFT / D-RIGHT .... change value (hold to fast-scroll)
     L1 / R1 ............. previous / next page
     CROSS ............... toggle / run action
     TRIANGLE ............ reset this line to default
     CIRCLE .............. save + exit

   TRICKSHOTS:
     Any D-pad direction with a macro bound to it fires that macro and
     is blocked from the game. Directions left on OFF pass straight
     through, so you keep your scorestreaks on those. Set a MODIFIER
     on the TRICKSHOT page if you'd rather keep all four directions.

     Calibrate SPIN 360ms first - it is the time your stick needs for
     one full rotation at YOUR sensitivity. Everything else derives
     from it. See the README for the calibration method.
   ------------------------------------------------------------------
   GPC NOTES: no local variables exist - every working variable is
   declared at top level and prefixed by its owning function. Strings
   live in the data section; print() takes an address, not a literal,
   and there is no %d, so numbers go through print_num().

   SCREEN BUDGET (128 x 64, small font 7px wide / 8px tall):
     header   y 0..11
     rows     y 15, 25, 35, 45, 55   (10px pitch, 2px clear between)
     labels   x 3   (max 10 chars -> ends at 73)
     values   x 76  (max  6 chars -> ends at 118)
     scrollbr x 121..125
   ================================================================== */


